{"about_the_game":"STRAY GIRL \ud83d\udd1e is an adult visual novel that blends mystery, learning mechanics, and unexpected discoveries. A tech-savvy tinkerer stumbles upon a broken android girl and decides to repair her. With her memory wiped, she requires step-by-step guidance to regain lost knowledge. Through unconventional lessons and interactions with everyday objects, her understanding of the world\u2014and her purpose\u2014gradually takes shape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, reactivating her triggers an unexpected response: a scientist from her past arrives, revealing a hidden history that ties the android to something far bigger than a simple repair job. As the corporation that once owned her closes in, the protagonist must decide whether to let her go or keep her by his side, leading to one of two possible outcomes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnconventional Learning: Guide the android\u2019s rediscovery of the world through unique interactions and unexpected results.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA Story of Discovery: Piece together fragments of her past and uncover the secrets hidden in her code.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCorporate Secrets &amp; Shadows: A former owner wants her back\u2014but why? Dive into a world of hidden agendas and lost memories.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnexpected Reactions: Every lesson has consequences, some logical, some... less so.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHigh-Quality Adult Content: Beautiful CG art and animations that evolve with the android\u2019s reawakening.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626750?t=1745427571","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626750?t=1745427571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626750/1f061f62c6278b07d789fec905cdd404089894d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745427571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626750/1f061f62c